course: dictionary
lesson: 14718
title: Short words and titles
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: A prof is a short, informal way of saying professor. A professor is a teacher of the highest rank at a university. «My cousin studies stars, and her prof gives lectures to hundreds of students.» The word prof is the clue that the teacher works at a university.
explain: Prof. with a full stop is a written short form used as a title before a name, like «Prof. Jane Smith». The full stop shows the word has been shortened. Dr. and Mr. work in the same way.
explain: In stories and films, «the Prof» is often a nickname for a clever scientist or inventor. Like other nicknames, it tells you what the character does, not their real name. Look at the clues around the word to see whether it means a university teacher or a character.
fact: Prof is an informal short form of professor.
fact: A professor is a teacher of the highest rank at a university.
fact: Prof. with a full stop is a written short form used before a name, such as «Prof. Jane Smith».
fact: In stories, «the Prof» is often a clever scientist or inventor character.
exercise: «My uncle is a prof at the university.» What is a prof? | A student who is just starting school | A park keeper | *A professor, a teacher at a university | A type of robot
exercise: «Prof. Jane Smith will open the science centre.» What does Prof. show? | It means the first day of term | It shows the speaker is angry | *It is a title used before a name, short for professor | It is the name of a street
exercise: In the film, «the Prof» builds a rocket in his garden shed. What kind of character is the Prof? | A shy dog | A school cook | A kind of cloud | *A clever scientist or inventor
test: «The prof answered every question in the lecture hall.» What does prof mean here? | A loud bell | *A university professor | A cold drink
test: «Prof. Ahmed writes books about history.» Why is Prof. written before the name? | It is the first letter of his surname | *It is a short written title, like Dr. | It shows Ahmed is the speaker's pet | It means Ahmed is angry
exam: Which is the correct way to write the title for Professor Lee on an envelope? | *Prof. Lee | Lee, Prof | Profs Lee | Professing Lee
